udFront; frame-ancestors 'none'; strict-transport-security 2y; referrer-policy strict-origin.\\\\n   • Form submissions protected by AWS WAF rules (SQLi/XSS) if behind CloudFront.\\\\n\\\\n7. Cost Awareness\\\\n   • Front-end hosting (Amplify) ≈ $0.01 / GB served.\\\\n   • Cognito MAUs: first 50 k free; thereafter $0.0055 per MAU.\\\\n   • React-query & Tailwind introduce zero extra AWS cost.\\\\n\\\\n8. Future Enhancements (out of scope for v1 but planned)\\\\n   • PWA offline caching via service workers.\\\\n   • i18n (react-i18next) for multilingual residents.\\\\n   • Push notifications via SNS + Service Workers for dues reminders.\\\\n\\\\nEND OF REPORT\\\",\\n  \\\"originalOrderSequenceID\\\": \\\"dep-plan-fe-01\\\"\\n}\\n###dep-plan-fe-01-report###\"}]},\"finishReason\":\"stop\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":3374,\"outputTokens\":2380,\"totalTokens\":5754},\"custom\":{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-BvVx8bYwCj6QLrMxCkUqJrDoQonML\",\"object\":\"chat.completion\",\"created\":1753047222,\"model\":\"o3-2025-04-16\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"###dep-plan-fe-01-report###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: REPORT\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"reportString\\\": \\\"DEP – FRONTEND ARCHITECTURE PLAN FOR HOA WEBSITE\\\\n--------------------------------------------------\\\\nAuthor: Director-rank Agent Kallus\\\\nResponding To Order ID: dep-plan-fe-01\\\\n\\\\n0. Assumptions & External Dependencies\\\\n   • Architecture Directorate will expose the hosting pattern (likely AWS Amplify Hosting or S3 + CloudFront) and supply the Cognito User-Pool / Identity-Pool IDs.\\\\n   • Backend Directorate will expose either REST endpoints (via API Gateway) or GraphQL schema (via AppSync).  Endpoint names used below are placeholders and will be concretised once published.\\\\n   • All resources will reside in the same AWS account & region.\\\\n\\\\n1. Technology Stack\\\\n   • React 18 + TypeScript\\\\n   • React Router v6 for client-side routing\\\\n   • Tailwind CSS for styling /